# Live provider run (Issue #54) -- variable NAMES only, never values.
#
# The default test run and `pnpm run check` never touch these; they are read
# only by an explicit live run (`uv run pytest -m live` for a live-marked
# probe, or the sidecar driven against real providers). See the
# repository-root `.env.example` for what each one means, and
# `docs/quality-gates.md` for the reproduction procedure. Real values go in
# `backend/.env.local` (git-ignored) or the host environment -- never in a
# commit, a log, or an artifact.
#
# Authentication is Application Default Credentials, not an API key:
# `gcloud auth application-default login`, or GOOGLE_APPLICATION_CREDENTIALS
# pointing at a service-account / Workload Identity Federation file that lives
# outside this repository.
GOOGLE_APPLICATION_CREDENTIALS=
AUTO_SCORING_VERTEX_PROJECT=
AUTO_SCORING_VERTEX_LOCATION=
AUTO_SCORING_GEMINI_MODEL=
AUTO_SCORING_DOCUMENT_AI_PROCESSOR=
